  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Formulation workshop Green Growth for Jobs</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this project is to further develop a full project proposal for the European Union (EU)-Private Sector Development Action on Green Growth for Jobs, including a break-down of the budget and the management structure.This will be done through the organisation of a formulation workshop with all four stakeholders. These are the EU delegation to Ghana, the Netherlands Enterprise Agency (RVO), United Nations Capital Development Fund (UNCDF) and Expertise France.</narrative>
  </description>
